      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The kougaï raises its pincers in an intimidating imitation of eyes. <em>Saving Throw:</em> DC 14 Wisdom, each creature in a 60-foot Emanation originating from the kougaï that can see it. <em>Failure:</em> The target is Frightened of the kougaï and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically. While Frightened, the target's Speed is reduced to 0. <em>Success:</em> The target is immune to this effect for 24 hours.</p>",
          "chat": ""
